<speak>
<s>This is your Jumu'ah briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">01052026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Iran's Mojtaba Khamenei has declared a new legal framework over the Strait of Hormuz, the waterway that carries one-fifth of the world's oil.</s> <s>Tehran is rejecting toll-free American access and signalling indefinite control, while Pakistan mediates indirect talks.</s> <s>What was a strike-and-counterstrike war is hardening into the structural seizure of a chokepoint.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The United States Supreme Court struck down Louisiana's Black-majority congressional district as an unconstitutional racial gerrymander.</s> <s>Baton Rouge must redraw the map by the first of June, the May primaries are at risk, and Democrats lose a seat in the bargain.</s> <s>It's the first major test of the post-twenty-twenty-five Voting Rights Act framework, and other challenged states are watching.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Washington has rerouted one thousand Afghan allies — interpreters, contractors, and their families promised American asylum — to Kinshasa instead of the United States.</s> <s>Their resettlement was bundled into a December minerals deal with Congo, trading asylum for cobalt and copper access.</s> <s>Protesters were arrested in Kinshasa last week, and refugee obligations now move as a bargaining chip in resource diplomacy.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The sixty-day limit under America's nineteen seventy-three War Powers Resolution expired Friday with no vote to end the Iran war passing Congress.</s> <s>Republicans have blocked every withdrawal vote since the twenty-eighth of February, and Tehran is warning of long and painful reprisals.</s> <s>The statute meant to bind a wartime president has, this week, run out of time.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Russia's Defence Ministry will hold its twenty-fifth Victory Day in Red Square without a single tank.</s> <s>Ukraine has destroyed thousands of Russian armoured vehicles since twenty-twenty-two, and Moscow cited the operational situation in stripping its parade.</s> <s>Kyiv's Zelenskyy responded by calling Trump rather than Moscow, asking whether the proposed pause means a few hours for a parade or something larger.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Myanmar's junta has cut Aung San Suu Kyi's prison sentence to roughly eighteen years and moved her from prison to house arrest ahead of staged elections.</s> <s>Her son says no one has contacted him, and more than thirty thousand other political prisoners receive no equivalent amnesty.</s> <s>Naypyidaw is rehearsing leniency for one face while the cells stay full.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Seventeen Sudanese refugees drowned off Tobruk this week, with nine still missing.</s> <s>Families fleeing Sudan's civil war are now reaching eastern Libya — eighteen hundred kilometres from Khartoum — because Egypt has tightened its border and the central Mediterranean route is saturated.</s> <s>The <sub alias="U N">UN</sub> refugee agency said ending Sudan's war is the only durable answer.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>An Israeli double-tap strike killed first responders in southern Lebanon, a second missile timed to hit arriving rescuers.</s> <s>The tactic was documented in Syria and Yemen and is now recorded in Lebanon, where <sub alias="U N">UN</sub> monitors count one-point-two-four million people food-insecure.</s> <s>Pakistan's Sindh province, in quieter news, will distribute Hindu religious textbooks to grades three through five — Hindu pupils there had studied Islamiyat by default.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Reporters Without Borders has put global press freedom at a twenty-five-year low, with Saudi Arabia executing a journalist this year and the share of the world living under good press conditions falling from twenty percent to under one.</s> <s>The United States slid seven places to sixty-fourth.</s> <s>The group called for meaningful sanctions, knowing no international body can compel states that jail or kill reporters.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Tepic, Mexican forces arrested El Jardinero, the synthetic-drug coordinator the United States had tagged with a five-million-dollar bounty.</s> <s>He oversaw fentanyl and methamphetamine production for the Jalisco New Generation Cartel across six states.</s> <s>Mexico has now taken down two top cartel figures in sixty days, and no successor has been named.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>American gasoline averaged four dollars and twenty-four cents a gallon in April as tankers rerouted to higher-paying Asian buyers.</s> <s>The United States burns twice as much oil per dollar of output as the European Union, so the Hormuz shock lands harder on American pumps than on Beijing or Brussels.</s> <s>Energy independence, it turns out, doesn't insulate a country from a global price.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Eurozone inflation hit three percent in April, with Brent above one hundred and twenty dollars pushing energy costs to a two-year high.</s> <s>The European Central Bank held its deposit rate at two percent and warned that war risks have intensified.</s> <s>Economists now expect a twenty-five-basis-point cut, a path the Iran war has effectively chosen for Frankfurt.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Egypt is borrowing roughly half of its budget simply to function, with sixty-four percent of expenditure going to debt service and sixty piastres of every pound collected paying interest.</s> <s>The official budget assumes forty-seven pounds to the dollar and nine-point-three percent inflation, but the dollar trades at fifty-three and March inflation ran at thirteen-point-five.</s> <s>Cairo's arithmetic and Cairo's reality are no longer the same document.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Belgium has suspended its nuclear dismantling programme and will nationalise seven reactors, reversing a phase-out law on the books since two thousand and three.</s> <s>France's Engie had been the designated exit party and priced decommissioning at eight-point-four billion euros, in sha'Allah a final settlement now follows.</s> <s>The twenty-twenty-two gas crisis and the Iran war reversed Brussels' calculation about what the grid can afford to retire.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Beijing has placed binding fossil-fuel caps on every province, the first dual-body directive jointly binding Communist Party committees and government agencies at every level.</s> <s>Officials called the move extremely rare, and analysts call it the foundation for China's energy transition.</s> <s>It lands the same week American gasoline prices spike — two trajectories visibly diverging.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The joint American-Indian <sub alias="NISAR">NISAR</sub> radar satellite has produced its first major dataset, mapping centimetre-scale subsidence beneath Mexico City through clouds and vegetation that block optical sensors.</s> <s>Real-time, all-weather radar coverage of every city on Earth at this resolution simply did not exist until now.</s> <s>The same instrument will soon expose the sinking foundations of Jakarta, Tehran, Lagos, and Dhaka.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A study in Science Advances attributes two thousand and forty-five excess deaths a year to wildfire ozone, with the wildfire share of ozone mortality rising from a six percent average to twenty-six percent in twenty-twenty-three.</s> <s>The authors called for updated ozone warning systems built for a smoke-saturated atmosphere.</s> <s>Twenty-twenty-three was the worst year in the dataset, but it isn't likely to hold that record long.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Craig Venter, who halved the Human Genome Project's timeline through Celera's whole-genome shotgun sequencing, has died in San Diego.</s> <s>His method — random fragmentation and computational reassembly — erased the public consortium's decade-long head start.</s> <s>Sequencing a human genome cost three billion dollars when he began and roughly two hundred today.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Hyperscale artificial-intelligence data centres are landing across Malaysia, Indonesia, Vietnam, and the Philippines, none of which require an environmental impact assessment before construction.</s> <s>Communities are rarely consulted on water draws, grid loadshedding, or land conversions, and experts warn many sites risk becoming stranded assets if the revenue never arrives.</s> <s>The compute the West uses is being fed by infrastructure that wouldn't be permitted at home.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Japan has endorsed its first domestic loitering munition, a two-thousand-dollar cardboard drone from the startup AirKamuy that ships flatpacked like furniture.</s> <s>The price matches the disposable first-person-view drones Ukraine has been fielding by the thousand.</s> <s>Defence Minister Koizumi backed the model, and Tokyo wants its industrial base in the export market that Kyiv pioneered.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Google's Gemini will now mix users' email summaries into model training by default, and opting out requires disabling Gemini Apps Activity, which also deletes chat history.</s> <s>That setting is absent from the main privacy page, while the company has announced one hundred and eighty-five billion dollars in artificial-intelligence investment for next year.</s> <s>Consent for training is being bundled with continuity of service.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>An American surveillance firm, Flock Safety, was found accessing city camera feeds in Dunwoody, Georgia — including a children's gym, a pool, and a Jewish community centre — to demo its system to other police departments.</s> <s>Its stated policy bars employees from such access, and Dunwoody renewed the contract anyway.</s> <s>Stated policy and lived practice, once again, are not the same document.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>